<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Steiner Leisure started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Steiner Leisure started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz analyst Barry Rothberg said he initiated coverage of Steiner Leisure Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company is uniquely positioned to benefit from the steady growth in passenger capacity (estimated at eight percent annually) coupled with the ongoing trend among the leading cruise lines building progressively bigger and more elegant spa facilities,&quot; Rothberg said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 14-3/8.</p>
</text>
